Chimney Height (Feet) Minimum Permanent Free Opening (Square Inches) a 8 13 20 29 39 51 64 Appliance Input Rating (BTU Per Hour) Chimney Height (Feet) Minimum Permanent Free Opening (Square Inches) a 8 13 20 29 39 51 64 Appliance Input Rating (BTU Per Hour) 6 7,800 14,000 23,200 34,000 46,400 62,400 8,000 8 8,400 15,200 25,200 37,000 50,400 68,000 86,000 10 9,000 16,800 27,600 40,400 55,800 74,400 96,400 15 9,800 18,200 30,200 44,600 62,400 84,000 108,800 20 10,600 20,200 32,600 50,400 68,400 94,000 122,200 30 11,200 21,600 36,600 55,200 76,800 105,800 138,600 For SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm, 1 foot = 304.8 mm, 1 square inch = 645.16 m 2 , 1 British thermal unit per hour = 0.2931 W. a. The first six minimum permanent free openings (8 to 51 square inches) correspond approximately to the cross-sectional areas of chimneys having diameters of 3 through 8 inches, respectively. The 64-square-inch opening corresponds to the cross-sectional area of standard 8-inch by 8-inch chimney tile. Section FGC 635: Gaseous Hydrogen Systems"}]}
